{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Septura, everyone is smarter than you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you\u2019ll need to outsmart bizarre aliens, steal their intellect, and grow sharp enough to keep up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Septurian Might</strong> is a story-driven platforming action RPG set in a vast, hand-drawn alien world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >filled with quirky characters, challenging combat, and a journey shaped by humor, emotion, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy you defeat makes you stronger. Steal their abilities, use their power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master punishing combat where every swing matters and every mistake stings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 100+ enemies and over 30 brutal bosses, from mischievous critters to towering beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend stolen intellect across 25 unique skills and 100+ abilities. Your build, your call.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together stolen memories to unlock hidden quests and buried lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-drawn alien landscapes packed with challenging platforming, mind-bending puzzles, and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the story through your choices. Multiple endings based on who you help and who you betray.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO OUT NOW!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A free demo is available now featuring the entire first chapter \u2014 a hefty taste of what's to come.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAQ (Freakishly Annoying Questions):\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: When is the game releasing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: The release date is a closely guarded secret... even from me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Is this a solo project?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Yes, a solo project. Plus seven art wizards who make the game not look like garbage. Which it definitely would if I did all the drawing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Will my potato PC run it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: It's hand-drawn 2D, not Crysis. You should be fine... probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Does the game have controller support?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Absolutely. I'm not a monster. Full support for Dualshock and Xbox controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753240?t=1771174090","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753240?t=1771174090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/a2391e42e6984aaaa1865c346579ef0995c78c7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771174090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/a2391e42e6984aaaa1865c346579ef0995c78c7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771174090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Septura, everyone is smarter than you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you\u2019ll need to outsmart bizarre aliens, steal their intellect, and grow sharp enough to keep up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Septurian Might</strong> is a story-driven platforming action RPG set in a vast, hand-drawn alien world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >filled with quirky characters, challenging combat, and a journey shaped by humor, emotion, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy you defeat makes you stronger. Steal their abilities, use their power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master punishing combat where every swing matters and every mistake stings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 100+ enemies and over 30 brutal bosses, from mischievous critters to towering beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend stolen intellect across 25 unique skills and 100+ abilities. Your build, your call.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together stolen memories to unlock hidden quests and buried lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-drawn alien landscapes packed with challenging platforming, mind-bending puzzles, and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the story through your choices. Multiple endings based on who you help and who you betray.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO OUT NOW!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A free demo is available now featuring the entire first chapter \u2014 a hefty taste of what's to come.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAQ (Freakishly Annoying Questions):\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: When is the game releasing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: The release date is a closely guarded secret... even from me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Is this a solo project?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Yes, a solo project. Plus seven art wizards who make the game not look like garbage. Which it definitely would if I did all the drawing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Will my potato PC run it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: It's hand-drawn 2D, not Crysis. You should be fine... probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Does the game have controller support?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Absolutely. I'm not a monster. Full support for Dualshock and Xbox controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Aman Trivedi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/7f620a7a419c806cccbb75dae4d3f6d13a379fa0/header.jpg?t=1771174090","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 (High Sierra) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (4 cores) or Apple Silicon (M1)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon R9 M380 / Intel Iris Pro 5200 (Metal support required)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (Skylake or newer) or Apple Silicon (M1/M2)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 570 / Apple M1 GPU (Metal support required)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3753240/2006508705/3849248b17eaea9aa7e15ab340076a747693f143/1761160431/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761161933","dash_